    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6111" root="جلد" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِلْدَةٌ</span></b>  a more particular term than <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِلْدٌ</span>; (S,
L;) signifying <i>A piece,</i> or <i>portion, of skin.</i> (L.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One says also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِلْدَةُ العَيْنِ</span> [app. meaning <i>The
eyelid</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْمٌ مِنْ جِلْدَتِنَا</span> <i>A people,</i>
or <i>company of men, of ourselves,</i> and <i>of our
kinsfolk.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلْدٌ</span>.

